  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nConsider this example:\n\n```html\n<!doctype html>\n<select id=s style=\"appearance: base-select\">\n  <button>\n    <selectedcontent></selectedcontent>\n  </button>\n  <option id=o selected>ABC</option>\n</select>\n<script>\nonload = () => {\n  document.querySelector(\"#o\").textContent = \"DEF\";\n};\n</script>\n```\n\nI would expect the selectedcontent's content to be \"DEF\", it's \"ABC\" though.\n\ncc @josepharhar @keithamus @emilio ",
